<p>We ask visitors to borrow only for a purpose they understand and can discuss honestly. An application should reflect a real livelihood need, not a hope that the form itself will produce money.</p>
<p class="mt-4">If a request moves forward, we expect conversations about repayment capacity to happen with the people reviewing the file — not through automatic messages from this website.</p>
<p class="mt-4">If you feel pressured or confused, stop and contact the office listed on the contact page before sending another form.</p>
